        "original_id": "16df8786-4998-5752-bac0-e2d7e11a4ef0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cathal Coughlan, Nick Allum, Jonathan Fell, Zac Woolhouse, Aindrias O'Gruama, Tony Karlsson, Bobby Amaro, Kevin Brown\n- Organizations: The Fatima Mansions, Microdisney, Nude\n- Places: Cork, Hollywood\n- Products: Lost in the Former West, Valhalla Avenue\n\nFacts:\n- In 1988, The Fatima Mansions formed as an art rock group.\n- Cathal Coughlan, a singer and keyboardist from Cork, formed The Fatima Mansions after previously being a member of Microdisney.\n- The original line-up of The Fatima Mansions consisted of Cathal Coughlan, Nick Allum, Jonathan Fell, Zac Woolhouse, and Aindrias O'Gruama.\n- In 2004, Nude formed in Hollywood.\n- The original members of Nude were Swedish singer and guitarist Tony Karlsson, drummer Bobby Amaro, and bassist Kevin Brown.\n- Lost in the Former West was the final album released by The Fatima Mansions.\n- Lost in the Former West continued The Fatima Mansions' focus on hard-rock anthems that had begun on Valhalla Avenue.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
